  "seoBody": "<h2>What is an audit management system for care homes?</h2><p>An audit management system for care homes is the software that holds every recurring audit a home has to run, prompts the right person when each is due, records the answers and evidence on the day, turns findings into tracked actions, and rolls every home up into one view for the group. In a care home it typically manages mock CQC or Care Inspectorate inspections, infection prevention and control, health and safety, medication storage, safeguarding, care plan reviews, the training matrix, food hygiene, and accident and RIDDOR records.</p><h2>What should it do?</h2><p>Four things. Schedule recurring audits and prompt the right person. Capture evidence with timestamped photos on the day. Track each finding to a closed action. Give the group one dashboard across every home. Most systems are apps with a login, and the adoption problem is getting staff to open them on the floor, so audits get back-filled from memory.</p><h2>How quickler delivers it over WhatsApp</h2><p>Quickler does all four jobs, but the person doing the audit never opens an app. Each prompt arrives in their own WhatsApp and they reply by text, voice note or photo. Voice notes are transcribed automatically, and a photo can be attached against any finding as timestamped evidence. When an audit is finished, quickler produces a shareable web report and a permanent record, turns each issue into a tracked action, and updates the group dashboard.</p><h2>What quickler is not</h2><p>Quickler is an audit and evidence tool. It is not a care records system, it is not an eMAR, and it is not a clinical record of any resident. It manages your audits and the evidence trail around them, and it sits alongside your care planning and eMAR system, which stays the single source of truth for anything clinical.</p><h2>Pricing</h2><p>Pricing is only for active users: [[price:bundles]]. An active user is someone who completed at least two workflows that month, so you add your whole team and only pay for who actually works.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What is an audit management system for care homes?</h3><p>It is the software that schedules a home's recurring audits, captures the evidence with photos on the day, tracks each finding to a closed action, and rolls every home up into one dashboard for the group.</p><h3>Is there an audit management system for care homes with no app?</h3><p>Yes. Quickler runs the whole audit cycle over WhatsApp, with nothing to install and no login for the person doing the audit.</p><h3>Is quickler a care records or eMAR system?</h3><p>No. Quickler is an audit and evidence tool, not a care records, eMAR or clinical system. It sits alongside your care records system rather than replacing it.</p>",
